tatus='Preview: value 11 = 0 · clear bottom-out calibration data'}>Clear bottom-out data</Button><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">This protocol prints calibration data to the firmware console; it does not establish live per-key sensor streaming over VIA.</p></div><p class="mt-5 text-sm" role="status">{status}</p></div>
